! Jay's Brochure

((Jay Kominek)) has made a ((Jay's Lojban Brochure|nice double-sided brochure)) available.

! CafePress Stores

Several lojbanists have made CafePress stores.  Note that, as
far as I know, none of the revenues from these stores go to the LLG.

* [http://www.cafeshops.com/cp/store.aspx?s=logfest|The LogFest Store] by ((Mark Shoulson)).
* [http://www.cafepress.com/logfest2|The Older Items LogFest Store], also by ((Mark Shoulson)).
* [http://www.cafeshops.com/cp/store.aspx?s=lojban|The Lojban Store] by ((Jay Kominek)).
* [http://www.cafepress.com/mathomhouse/784511|The Lojban Store At Mathomhouse] by ((Hal Fulton)).
* [http://www.cafepress.com/vixshop|VixShop] by ((Viktor Medrano)).